          "merged_at": "2026-09-02T01:51:35Z"
        },
        "body": "## Summary\n\nPorts the valid timestamp parsing fix from the old stacked PR #114 onto a clean branch based directly on the current `main`.\n\nVinted may emit seller-message timestamps such as `1.09.2026, 12:27:39`. The current parser requires a zero-padded day (`dd.MM.yyyy`) and therefore fails to persist the seller activity time for those messages.\n\n### Changes\n\n- accept one- or two-digit day/month using `d.M.yyyy, HH:mm:ss`\n- keep invalid/unrecognized timestamps fail-closed as `null`\n- add regression coverage for current, zero-padded, single-digit day/month and invalid formats\n\nNo schema changes. No unrelated code from the old stacked branches is included.",
